<[Doug] D.PHILIPS2> you're executing in one particular place.  With a loop, you 
also need to know
<[Doug] D.PHILIPS2> which iteration you're on.
<[Len] NMORGENSTERN> ususal Forth inmplementation of it. Sometimes you wish
<[Len] NMORGENSTERN> that they would have used a third stack instead of the 
return stack.
